flowchart TB
  classDef statefill fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111827
  classDef human fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#111827
  classDef write fill:#ffedd5,stroke:#ea580c,color:#111827
  classDef safe fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#111827
  classDef block fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827

  EVIDENCE["Evidence + reconciliation + one ProposedAction"]:::statefill --> AR["interrupt()<br/>Human action review"]:::human
  AR --> DEC{"approve • edit • reject • escalate"}:::human
  DEC -->|edit| REVERIFY["Re-verify rationale-only edit"]:::statefill --> AR
  DEC -->|reject| OPEN["Keep open • no write"]:::block
  DEC -->|escalate| ESC["Escalate • no write"]:::block
  DEC -->|approve| RES["Command(resume=...)<br/>approval recorded • zero writes"]:::statefill
  RES --> EXEC["interrupt()<br/>Execution confirmation"]:::human
  EXEC -->|cancel| OPEN
  EXEC -->|confirm exact execution ID + key| NODE["Approved graph node<br/>one write / version"]:::statefill
  NODE --> MCP["Recall Operations MCP<br/>simulated write"]:::write
  MCP --> RCPT["Durable receipt<br/>version +1 • approval invalidated"]:::safe
  RCPT --> NEXT{"Next action from authoritative state?"}:::statefill
  NEXT -->|action remains| AR
  NEXT -->|lost response| UNKNOWN["write_outcome_unknown<br/>human retry • exact same key"]:::human --> NODE
  NEXT -->|gap / ambiguity| BLOCK["Closure blocked<br/>Open — closure blocked"]:::human
  NEXT -->|all action predicates complete| CLOSURE["interrupt()<br/>separate closure review"]:::human
  CLOSURE --> CEXEC["Execution confirmation<br/>close_case only"]:::human --> NODE
